  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UGA Radio Media SME - Radio Media SME</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UGA Radio Media SME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till kommersiella radiostationer f&#xF6;r utveckling p&#xE5; kommersiella grunder av progran riktade till den privata sektorn.  S&#xE4;rskilt fokus p&#xE5; uth&#xE5;llighet, expnasion i Norra Uganda, samt grupper med h&#xF6;g HIV prevalens.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project support a sustainable development of commercial radio stations to develop and broadcasting to the private sector. A particular focus is on sustainability, northern Uganda and HIV affected communities.</narrative>
  </description>
